OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry at first with sunny spells
OL,6,Fand patchy cloud. Turning cloudier
OL,7,Ffrom the south with heavy, thundery
OL,8,Frain pushing northwards through the
OL,9,Flate afternoon and during the evening.
OL,10,FFrequent lightning and large hail
OL,11,Fpossible. Feeling warm.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHeavy showers and thunder
OL,14,Fpush northwards leaving a drier night
OL,15,Fto come with some clearer spells.
OL,16,FPatchy cloud building later but a mild
OL,17,Fnight to come.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
