OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly dry start, but patchy
OL,6,Frain builds. Turns heavier through the
OL,7,Fmorning, turning thundery in places.
OL,8,FEasing through the afternoon. Staying
OL,9,Fwarm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAn
OL,12,Funsettled bank holiday weekend with
OL,13,Fshowers and possibly more thunder on
OL,14,Fthe way. Staying warm to start with
OL,15,Fbut turning fresher as winds shift to
OL,16,Fa westerly by Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
